## Seek Layer

Each DCP profile includes the top **2–3 Seeks** — what the nervous system is attempting to restore under threat.

| Seek | What Is Being Sought | Core Question |
|-----|----------------------|---------------|
| Justice | Fairness, rectification | “Who crossed a line?” |
| Status | Recognition, position | “Where do I stand?” |
| Threat | Safety, protection | “Am I safe?” |
| Order | Predictability, control | “How do I stabilize this?” |
| Worth | Value, acceptance | “Am I enough?” |

Seeks explain **why** a pattern fires.  
The same observable pattern can arise from different Seeks.

For neurobiological detail, see  
[`README.md#seek-specific-activation`](../README.md#seek-specific-activation)

