## Scoring

### Raw Score
Each pattern is scored **0–100**.

### Tier Classification

| Score | Tier | Interpretation |
|-----|------|----------------|
| 0–30 | Lo | Insufficient capacity |
| 31–39 | Lo-Med | Trending toward deficiency |
| 40–60 | Med | Appropriate capacity |
| 61–69 | Med-Hi | Trending toward excess |
| 70–100 | Hi | Excess capacity |

### Virtue-Mean Mapping

| Pattern | Deficiency | Virtue (Mean) | Excess |
|-------|------------|---------------|--------|
| Withdraw | Enmeshment | Regulated Space | Stonewalling |
| Escalate | Avoidance | Appropriate Assertion | Aggression |
| Negative Interpret | Naivety | Discernment | Paranoia |
| Invalidate | Boundarylessness | Empathic Validation | Dismissiveness |

