## Collision Topology

Conflict emerges from **pairings**, not individuals.

### Classic Pattern Collisions

| Person A | Person B | Dynamic |
|--------|----------|---------|
| Hi-Escalate | Hi-Withdraw | Pursuit–Distance |
| Hi-Escalate | Hi-Escalate | Escalation Spiral |
| Hi-Withdraw | Hi-Withdraw | Frozen Avoidance |
| Hi-NI | Hi-Invalidate | Contempt–Paranoia |
| Hi-Escalate | Lo-Escalate | Bulldozer–Doormat |
| Lo-Withdraw | Any Hi | Suffocation |

### Seek Collisions

| Seek A | Seek B | Dynamic |
|------|--------|---------|
| Justice | Worth | Prosecution–Collapse |
| Status | Status | Dominance Contest |
| Order | Threat | Control–Panic |
| Worth | Worth | Mutual reassurance (stable or spiral) |
| Justice | Justice | Competing moral frames |

> Predictive heat-mapping and coefficients are proprietary.

