## Relationship to Gottman

DCP is **upstream** of Gottman’s Four Horsemen.

| Gottman Horseman | DCP Origin |
|------------------|------------|
| Stonewalling | Hi-Withdraw |
| Criticism | Hi-Negative-Interpret |
| Contempt | Hi-Invalidate + Status Seek |
| Defensiveness | Worth/Status Seek → Counter-Escalate |

Gottman codes **behavior**.  
DCP models **processing architecture**.

---

## Intervention Direction

### Hi Patterns (Excess)
Constraint, moderation, alternatives.

### Lo Patterns (Insufficient)
Capacity-building, permission, practice.

*(Specific intervention protocols are proprietary.)*

